<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script>document.documentElement.className+=' js';</script>
<title>DMR Roof Restorations — Roof Restoration, Repairs &amp; Maintenance | Hunter Valley NSW</title>
<meta name="description" content="Licensed &amp; insured roof restoration across Glendon Brook, Singleton, Maitland and the Hunter Valley. Roof restorations, repairs and maintenance — free quotes, call 0478 041 709.">
<meta property="og:title" content="DMR Roof Restorations — Hunter Valley NSW">
<meta property="og:description" content="Roof restoration, maintenance and repairs. Licensed &amp; insured. Glendon Brook NSW — 0478 041 709.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="assets/favicon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Semi+Condensed:wght@500;600;700&family=Work+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" media="print" onload="this.media='all'">
<noscript><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Semi+Condensed:wght@500;600;700&family=Work+Sans:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"></noscript>
<style>
:root{
  --navy:#3B559A;
  --navy-deep:#26376B;
  --navy-dark:#1D2A52;
  --ink:#22305B;
  --muted:#5A688C;
  --cream:#D9EBB2;
  --creamy:#EEF4E6;
  --salmon:#F87C93;
  --salmon-bright:#FF9BAE;
  --mist:#F4F7FC;
  --mist2:#E9EEF8;
  --line:#D8DFEE;
  --dink:#F7FAFF;
  --dmut:#B9C5DE;
  --font-display:'Barlow Semi Condensed',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
  --font-sans:'Work Sans',ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--mist);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--font-sans);font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.62;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
img{max-width:100%;display:block}
a{color:inherit}
.wrap{width:min(1180px,92vw);margin-inline:auto}

/* reveal — html.js-gated */
html.js .drop{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px);transition:opacity .7s ease-out,transform .7s ease-out}
html.js .drop.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  html.js .drop{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
  *{animation-duration:.001s !important;transition-duration:.001s !important}
}

/* nav — logo sits flush on its own brand navy: no sticker look */
.nav{position:fixed;inset:0 0 auto 0;z-index:60;background:#35518F;border-bottom:2px solid rgba(248,124,147,.55)}
.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1.3rem;height:80px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;color:#fff;text-decoration:none}
.brand img{height:46px;width:auto;border-radius:0;display:block}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.5rem;letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:1;color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.brand-sub{display:block;font-size:.56rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--salmon-bright);font-weight:700;margin-top:3px}
.nav-links{display:flex;gap:1.35rem;margin-left:auto;align-items:center}
.nav-links a{color:#CDD7EE;text-decoration:none;font-size:.9rem;font-weight:600}
.nav-links a:hover{color:#fff}
.nav-cta{background:var(--salmon);color:#fff !important;padding:.55rem 1.2rem;border-radius:6px;font-weight:700}
.nav-cta:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
.burger{display:none;margin-left:auto;background:none;border:1px solid rgba(248,124,147,.6);border-radius:6px;padding:.4rem .6rem;cursor:pointer}
.burger span{display:block;width:20px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin:4px 0;transition:.3s}
.burger.open span:nth-child(1){transform:translateY(6px) rotate(45deg)}
.burger.open span:nth-child(2){opacity:0}
.burger.open span:nth-child(3){transform:translateY(-6px) rotate(-45deg)}
@media(max-width:920px){
  .nav-links{position:fixed;inset:80px 0 auto 0;background:var(--navy-deep);flex-direction:column;padding:1.2rem;gap:1rem;transform:translateY(-140%);transition:transform .35s ease;border-bottom:2px solid var(--salmon)}
  .nav-links.open{transform:none}
  .nav-links a{width:100%;text-align:center;padding:.5rem 0}
  .nav-cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:.3rem}
  .burger{display:block}
}

/* hero — clean brand-navy sky, real restored roof photo, gentle roofline cue */
.hero{position:relative;min-height:92vh;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#2E4278 0%,#3B559A 46%,#5E77B6 82%,#8AA3CD 100%);overflow:hidden;padding-top:80px}
.hero canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.hero-shade{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(20,30,60,.10) 0%,rgba(20,30,60,.0) 40%,rgba(20,30,60,.30) 100%);pointer-events:none}
/* roofline silhouette band — the roofing cue */
.roofline{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;z-index:1;height:120px;pointer-events:none;opacity:.5}
.roofline svg{width:100%;height:100%;display:block}
.hero-in{position:relative;z-index:2;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:clamp(28px,4vw,60px);align-items:center;padding-block:8vh 5rem;width:100%}
@media(max-width:960px){.hero-in{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:6vh 3.4rem}}
.hero-card{position:relative;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(15,25,55,.5);border:6px solid #fff;background:#fff}
.hero-card img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;aspect-ratio:16/10.5;display:block}
.hero-card .cap{position:absolute;inset:auto 0 0 0;padding:.95rem 1.2rem;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(20,30,60,.92) 62%);color:#fff;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.02em}
.hero-card .tag{position:absolute;top:1rem;left:1rem;background:var(--salmon);color:#fff;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;padding:.42rem .8rem;border-radius:5px}
.hero-kicker{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.65rem;color:var(--cream);font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.26em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:1rem}
.hero-kicker::before{content:"";width:36px;height:3px;background:var(--salmon)}
.hero h1{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(2.6rem,6.5vw,5rem);line-height:1.02;color:var(--dink);font-weight:700;max-width:20ch;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.01em}
.hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--cream)}
.hero-sub{margin-top:1.1rem;color:#D9E1F3;font-size:clamp(.98rem,1.5vw,1.08rem);max-width:56ch;font-weight:400}
.hero-cta{display:flex;gap:.9rem;margin-top:1.8rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding:.85rem 1.55rem;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:.95rem;transition:transform .15s ease,filter .15s ease}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);filter:brightness(1.06)}
.btn-primary{background:var(--salmon);color:#fff}
.btn-ghost{border:1.5px solid rgba(247,250,255,.5);color:var(--dink)}
.hero-strip{margin-top:2.4rem;display:flex;gap:2.4rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-top:1px solid rgba(217,235,178,.45);padding-top:1.15rem}
.hero-strip p{color:#C3CFE9;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.hero-strip strong{display:block;color:var(--dink);font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.08rem;margin-top:.2rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cream)}

/* sections */
section{padding-block:5.2rem}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:1rem;margin-bottom:2.4rem}
.sec-head::before{content:"";width:40px;height:3px;background:var(--salmon);flex:none;align-self:center;border-radius:2px}
.sec-kicker{font-size:.69rem;letter-spacing:.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C24360;font-weight:700}
.sec-title{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.7rem);font-weight:700;line-height:1.08;margin-top:.35rem;max-width:26ch;color:var(--navy-deep);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.01em}
.sec-sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:60ch;margin-top:.85rem;font-weight:400}

/* services */
.restore-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(316px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.svc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:1.7rem 1.55rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;transition:border-color .2s ease,transform .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease}
.svc:hover{border-color:var(--salmon);transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(38,55,107,.12)}
.svc::after{content:"";position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:44px;height:3px;background:var(--salmon);transition:width .3s ease}
.svc:hover::after{width:100%}
.svc-ico{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--navy-deep),var(--navy));display:grid;place-items:center;margin-bottom:.95rem}
.svc-ico svg{width:22px;height:22px;stroke:var(--salmon-bright);fill:none;stroke-width:1.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.svc h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.2rem;color:var(--navy-deep);margin-bottom:.35rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}
.svc p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.94rem;line-height:1.6}

/* process band */
.coat-band{background:var(--navy-deep);border-block:2px solid rgba(248,124,147,.5)}
.coat-band .sec-title{color:var(--dink)}
.coat-band .sec-kicker{color:var(--cream)}
.coat-band .sec-sub{color:#B9C5DE}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(234px,1fr));gap:1.15rem}
.step{background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid rgba(248,124,147,.35);border-radius:12px;padding:1.55rem 1.45rem}
.step-n{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.9rem;line-height:1;color:var(--cream);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:700}
.step h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--dink);margin-bottom:.3rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}
.step p{color:#B9C5DE;font-size:.91rem;line-height:1.6}

/* why */
.why-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.16fr .84fr .74fr;gap:2.2rem;align-items:start}
@media(max-width:980px){.why-block{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.why-list{display:grid;gap:1.05rem}
.why-item{display:flex;gap:.95rem;align-items:flex-start}
.why-tick{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:var(--salmon);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-top:.2rem}
.why-tick svg{width:14px;height:14px;stroke:#fff;fill:none;stroke-width:2.8;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}
.why-item h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--navy-deep);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.02em}
.why-item p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem;margin-top:.1rem}
.spec-list{display:grid;gap:.9rem}
.spec{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.2rem}
.spec b{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;font-size:1.3rem;color:var(--navy-deep);display:block;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase}
.spec span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.86rem}
/* roof scene panel — SVG, not a logo-as-photo */
.roof-panel{border-radius:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(180deg,#E7EEF9,#F8FAFE);padding:1.4rem;text-align:center}
.roof-panel svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}
.roof-panel p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:.8rem;font-size:.86rem;text-align:center}

/* zones */
.gb-zones{background:var(--mist2);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}
.chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.65rem;margin-top:1.3rem}
.chip{border:1px solid rgba(59,85,154,.45);border-radius:999px;padding:.5rem 1.15rem;font-size:.88rem;color:var(--navy-deep);background:#fff;font-weight:600}

/* footer */
footer{background:var(--navy-dark);border-top:2px solid rgba(248,124,147,.55);color:#B9C5DE;padding-block:4rem 1.8rem}
.foot-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.07fr .93fr;gap:2.8rem}
@media(max-width:880px){.foot-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}}
.foot-brand{display:flex;gap:.9rem;align-items:center;margin-bottom:1.05rem}
.foot-brand img{height:52px;width:auto;border-radius:4px}
.foot-brand-name{font-family:var(--font-display);color:var(--dink);font-size:1.3rem;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}
.foot-brand-sub{font-size:.55rem;letter-spacing:.24em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--cream);font-weight:700}
.foot h4{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:700;color:var(--dink);font-size:1.05rem;margin-bottom:.8rem;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.03em}
.foot p,.foot a{font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.85;color:#B9C5DE;text-decoration:none}
.foot a:hover{color:var(--dink)}
.foot-bottom{border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.14);padding-top:1.4rem;margin-top:2.6rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.78rem;color:#93A3C8}
section#lbq{--lbq-bg:#F4F7FC;--lbq-ink:#22305B;--lbq-muted:#5A688C;--lbq-panel:#FFFFFF;--lbq-line:#D8DFEE;--lbq-accent:#C24360}
</style>
<style id="lb-brand-css">
/* ==== LB BRAND (logo-true spanning wordmark) ==== */
.lb-brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:clamp(9px,1vw,16px);text-decoration:none;
 color:inherit;min-width:0;padding:0;background:none;border:0;flex:0 1 auto}
.lb-brand__mark{flex:0 0 auto;display:block;height:clamp(34px,4.1vw,58px);width:auto;max-width:22vw}
.lb-brand__mark img{display:block;height:100%;width:auto;max-width:22vw;object-fit:contain}
.lb-brand__word{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:0;line-height:.94}
.lb-brand__name{font-family:var(--lb-disp,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(21px,2.75vw,44px);letter-spacing:.004em;white-space:nowrap;line-height:.92;
 color:var(--lb-name,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__name .lb-acc{color:var(--lb-acc,currentColor)}
.lb-brand__sub{font-family:var(--lb-sub,Inter),sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;
 font-size:clamp(7px,.82vw,12px);letter-spacing:.30em;white-space:nowrap;margin-top:.34em;
 color:var(--lb-subc,currentColor);opacity:.86}
.lb-brand__rule{display:block;height:3px;width:100%;margin-top:.5em;border-radius:2px;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--lb-acc,currentColor),transparent)}
@media (max-width:640px){
 .lb-brand__mark{height:clamp(30px,8vw,40px)}
 .lb-brand__name{font-size:clamp(18px,6.2vw,26px)}
 .lb-brand__sub{letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:7px}
}
</style>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<nav class="nav" aria-label="Main">
  <div class="wrap nav-in">
    <a class="lb-brand" href="#top" aria-label="DMR Roof Restorations - Home" style="--lb-disp:Inter;--lb-sub:Inter;"><span class="lb-brand__word"><span class="lb-brand__name">DMR Roof Restorations</span><span class="lb-brand__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></a>
    <button class="burger" id="burger" aria-label="Toggle menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="navlinks">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
    <div class="nav-links" id="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#process">Our process</a>
      <a href="#areas">Service areas</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="#quote">Free quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="top">
  <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <canvas id="heroCanvas" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-shade"></div>
  <div class="roofline" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 1440 120" preserveAspectRatio="none" role="presentation">
      <path d="M0 120 L0 66 L120 14 L260 84 L380 20 L540 92 L660 30 L800 96 L930 26 L1080 88 L1210 34 L1350 90 L1440 52 L1440 120 Z" fill="#26376B"/>
      <path d="M0 120 L0 86 L130 44 L300 104 L420 52 L580 110 L700 62 L860 114 L980 58 L1130 108 L1260 66 L1440 104 L1440 120 Z" fill="#1D2A52"/>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap hero-in">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-kicker">Glendon Brook NSW &middot; Licensed &amp; Insured</p>
      <h1>Roofs brought back <em>to life.</em></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">DMR Roof Restorations — roof restoration, maintenance and repairs across Glendon Brook, Singleton and the Hunter Valley. Licensed and insured, with the prep work done properly so the finish lasts.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="tel:+61478041709">Call 0478 041 709</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-strip">
        <p><strong>Restoration</strong>tiles &amp; metal</p>
        <p><strong>Repairs</strong>leaks &amp; damage</p>
        <p><strong>Maintenance</strong>kept in shape</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-card">
      <span class="tag">Restored tile roof</span>
      <img src="assets/hero-restored-roof.jpg" alt="Recently restored tile roof — cleaned, repointed and coated" width="1200" height="790">
      <figcaption class="cap">Restored tile roof — cleaned, repointed and coated</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</header>
<section class="restore-intro" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Our services</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">From tired and leaking to restored and sound.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">Roof restoration, maintenance and repairs — done by a licensed and insured team that treats every roof like it is on their own home.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="restore-grid">
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 13L12 5l9 8"/><path d="M5 13v6h14v-6"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Full roof restorations</h3>
        <p>Complete restorations — cleaning, repairs, re-bedding, re-pointing and coating — bringing tired roofs back to their best.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v10"/><path d="M8 7l4 4 4-4"/><path d="M4 15h16v6H4z"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Roof repairs</h3>
        <p>Leaks, cracked tiles, damaged flashing and storm damage — found, fixed and sealed before they become bigger problems.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 19h16"/><path d="M7 19c1-3 2-6 5-6s4 3 5 6"/><path d="M12 8V4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Pressure cleaning</h3>
        <p>Years of grime, moss and lichen stripped back — the essential first step of any restoration done right.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 17h14"/><path d="M7 17V9l5-3 5 3v8"/><path d="M10 17v-4h4v4"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Re-coating &amp; sealing</h3>
        <p>Quality coatings and sealers applied properly — protecting the roof and lifting the look of the whole house.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 16h18"/><path d="M6 16V8h12v8"/><path d="M9 8V5h6v3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Gutters &amp; valleys</h3>
        <p>Gutters, valleys and downpipes cleared, repaired and kept flowing — water where it should be, not in your walls.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="svc drop">
        <div class="svc-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div>
        <h3>Ongoing maintenance</h3>
        <p>Regular checks and maintenance that keep a good roof good — catch the small things before they get expensive.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="coat-band" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head drop">
      <div>
        <p class="sec-kicker">Our process</p>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Inspect. Prepare. Restore. Protect.</h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">The finish is only as good as the preparation under it — that is where the care goes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">01</p><h3>Inspection &amp; quote</h3><p>We get up on the roof, find what is really going on, and give you a straight answer and a free quote.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">02</p><h3>Prep &amp; clean</h3><p>Pressure cleaning, moss treatment and repairs first — the coating only performs if the base is right.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">03</p><h3>Restore</h3><p>Re-bedding, re-pointing, sealing and coating — worked in properly, not rushed.</p></div>
      <div class="step drop"><p class="step-n">04</p><h3>Protect &amp; handover</h3><p>Final check, site cleaned up, and honest advice on looking after the roof from here.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="why">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="why-block">
      <div class="drop">
